[[file:TNT.png|50px]]
* Blocks movement.
* Can be destroyed by tears, explosions, stomping effects (such as {{i|Thunder Thighs}}), or certain effects that grant [[invulnerability]] (such as {{I|The Gamekid}} and {{i|My Little Unicorn}}).
* Explodes when destroyed.
* Small chance to drop a {{t|Match Stick}} or a {{t|Burnt Penny}} when destroyed.

