* Can be pushed around by Isaac and enemies.
* Can be destroyed by tears, explosions, or stompy effects.
** Unlike normal TNT, it cannot be destroyed by [[invulnerability]] effects and {{p|Hagalaz}}.
* Explodes when destroyed.
* Occasionally replaces normal TNT.
* Can be spawned with {{i|Mine Crafter}}.
** {{dlc|r}} Moveable TNT spawned by Mine Crafter takes a unique cubic appearance.
* Will explode when pushed into a [[Fire Place]], a [[Spiked Rock]], or a {{E|Red Poop}}.
